<Base title="Privacy" description="This website doesn't collect anything about you.">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>Short version: this website doesn't collect anything about you.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>No cookies.</li>
    <li>No analytics or tracking.</li>
    <li>No ads. Ever.</li>
    <li>No accounts or sign-ups.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. Like any web host, GitHub may keep basic server logs (such as IP addresses) to keep the service running; see <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub's privacy statement</a>.</p>
  <p>Each app has its own privacy page that explains what that app does and doesn't do. For Dog Stories, see the <a href="https://dogstories.sillywillyapps.com/privacy/">Dog Stories privacy policy</a>. For Fact Rally, see the <a href="/fact-rally/privacy/">Fact Rally privacy policy</a>.</p>
</Base>
